  "releaseNotes": "- [ThunderPropagator.BuildingBlocks#39] [Refactor] ExceptionInfo carries dual serializer attributes ([JsonProperty] + [JsonInclude]) on every property — fragile maintenance   ExceptionInfo.cs — dual-serializer attributes replaced with init properties:   - [JsonProperty, JsonInclude] removed from all 4 properties → { get; init; }   - [Newtonsoft.Json.JsonConstructor] removed from the private constructor; [System.Text.Json.Serialization.JsonConstructor] stays as the single canonical serializer attribute (STJ needs it to find   the private constructor)   - [Newtonsoft.Json.JsonConverter(typeof(ExceptionInfoNewtonsoftConverter))] added at the class level   - internal static Create(...) factory method added — uses object initializer syntax to set init properties from within the class (the only place that's allowed)",
